{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32116","headline":"夜宴谣 · 温庭筠","name":"夜宴谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长钗坠发双蜻蜓，碧尽山斜开画屏。\n虬须公子五侯客，一饮千锺如建瓴。\n鸾咽奼唱圆无节，眉歛湘烟袖回雪。\n清夜恩情四座同，莫令沟水东西别。\n亭亭蜡泪香珠残，暗露晓风罗幕寒。\n飘颻戟带俨相次，二十四枝龙画竿。\n裂管萦弦共繁曲，芳樽细浪倾春醁。\n高楼客散杏花多，脉脉新蟾如瞪目。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}